sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Studio user
  participant API as Definition API
  participant V as Validator
  participant R2 as Private R2
  participant A as Approvers
  U->>API: Create or patch draft
  API->>V: Run seven validation levels
  V-->>API: Validation report and digest
  API-->>U: Draft version
  U->>API: Submit for staged review
  A->>API: Independent approvals
  API->>R2: Write canonical bundle
  API->>R2: Read back and verify digest
  R2-->>API: Verified artifact
  API-->>U: Promoted immutable version
